~ start

William (Supporter): Salutations.

- What is your opinion of Christopher Columbus?
	
	William (Supporter): As an Italian man, I support him completely.
	William (Supporter): The Italian immigrants of today don't see as much recognition as they should, and he has given light to us.
	William (Supporter): Though he has made bad decisions, he brought us all over here and opened up new possibilites and standards for living.
	William (Supporter): That means more to me than anything.
	=> start
	
- Goodbye
	William (Supporter): See you.
	=> END
